Most monasteries provide appropriate attire for women who come unprepared, but if you bring your own clothing, especially bright-colored garments, you will receive a smile from a monk or nun upon entering.
Men are also required to wear pants that cover their knees, under similar conditions.
This item can also be borrowed from the warehouse located at the entrance, but the clothing is not washed after each use by the user, so you might not feel comfortable wearing these skirts. It's suitable for all men!
Majorcan cuisine, like similar regions in the Mediterranean, is based on bread, vegetables, and meat (especially pork) and uses olive oil from start to finish.
Pa amb Oli is a simple, beloved dinner, especially during summer: bread with olive oil, tomatoes, and any available toppings such as cheese, tuna fish, and the like.
All nouns, along with the word "Sie," always begin with a capital letter, even if they appear in the middle of a sentence.
This is an important method for distinguishing between certain verbs and their objects.
This also significantly makes reading easier, although writing is somewhat more complex and requires knowing whether a verb or adjective has been used correctly or not.
The pronunciation of Italian words is relatively simple, because the pronunciation of most words exactly matches their spelling.
The main letters you need to pay attention to are c and g, as their pronunciation varies depending on the vowel that follows them.
Also, be aware that "r" and "rr" are pronounced differently: "caro" means "dear," whereas "carro" means "car."
Persian grammar is relatively easy and mostly organized.
Therefore, reading this grammar primer will help you learn more about Persian grammar and better understand phrases.
It goes without saying that if you know one of the Romance languages, learning Portuguese will be easier for you.
Nevertheless, people who knew a little Spanish might hastily conclude that Portuguese is so similar that it doesn't require separate study.
Pre-modern observatories are now mostly abandoned and have become museums or educational centers.
Since light pollution was not initially considered a problem but is now regarded as one, these facilities are usually located in cities or on university campuses, making them easier to access compared to those built during the modern era.
Most modern research telescopes are large facilities located in remote areas with favorable weather conditions.
Viewing cherry blossoms (hanami) has been part of Japanese culture since the 8th century.
This concept originates from China, where the chosen flower was the plum blossom.
In Japan, the first cherry blossom ceremony is held by the Emperor and is attended exclusively by him and members of the imperial court's elite.
Plants are at their best when in their natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove "just one" specimen.
If a visit to the garden has been officially scheduled, collecting a «sample» without any discussion or conversation will result in your expulsion.
